            "review_title": "Review at Hanoi Gourmet",
            "review_text": "lita v\n2 contributions\n0\nThis place is heaven for gluten free or coeliacs. Fresh and tasty. The owner is lovley and very well spoken English.\nMay 2024 • Couples\nAbsolutely adorable. Everything is made with gf love. Waffles were beautiful. Well presented. Very quiet down a small ally. A gf diets dream. Must try everything!!! Pastries are to die for!\nWritten May 14, 2024",
