            "review_title": "Review at Hanoi Gourmet",
            "review_text": "Cat57BC\nCupertino, California23 contributions\n1\nLovely spot\nFeb 2019 • Family\nWe found Hanoi Gourmet just around the corner from our hotel. It's a lovely spot for a quick lunch of a ham and cheese sandwich on a baguette with salad and a latte. We had a great chat with the son of the owner, who had designed the remodeled space. Worth ducking into.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 18, 2019\nTedHG\nGreetings \nThanks for your positive feedback.\nMost appreciated. \nRegards\nTed\nHanoi Gourmet\nRead more\nWritten February 19, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
