            "review_title": "Review at Hanoi Gourmet",
            "review_text": "JJEast64\nOxfordshire, United Kingdom30 contributions\n0\nGreat for business lunches\nOct 2015 • Business\nTiny hole-in-the-wall, run by a Aussie - VN couple. Very popular for business lunches, gets busy and noisy when the Vietnamese men start on the red wine. Very good salads and cold-cuts plates, fresh baguettes. You can spend a lot of money on expensive wines, or just a few dollar on baguette with pate and salad. Usually fills up very quickly after 12:00 noon. Book if you want a table for a group.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 26, 2016\nTedHG\nGreetings\nThanks for your positive review. \nMost appreciated. \nCheers\nTed \nHanoi Gourmet\nRead more\nWritten February 29, 2016\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
