            "review_text": "EMM\nCape Town Central, South Africa12 contributions\n0\nOverpriced and average\nDec 2015 • Friends\nBasically an Italian deli / wine bar with restaurant upstairs. Serves plates of assorted cheeses, charcuterie, salmon, salads and baguettes. Hugely pricey wine list. Full of very noisy middle class locals clacking glasses in an alarmingly violent way saying cheers and flushing it down like beer Inbetween swirling the wine around oversized goblets. If you feel like some western / Italian food this is the place to come. VERY indifferent service and took about 1/2 hour to place an order despite being only moderately busy. Dong 700,000 for 2\nRead more\nWritten December 17, 2015",
